### Variáveis Globais
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3500
@username = carlao_admin
@password = fatec123

### 1. Criar um novo usuário (Sign Up)
POST {{baseUrl}}/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{username}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Realizar Login (Gera o Token JWT)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{username}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Armazenar o token da resposta acima
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Listar Usuários (Rota Protegida)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
